s10-p9 : Block
s10-p9 = prose (cons "A valid incremental update must transform a maintained result for \(d\) into one for \(d'\), including evidence that the updated result still denotes \(q(d')\). The statement is independent of whether the representation happens to be a database table, a spreadsheet cell, a UI widget, or a compiled cache. Codd’s relational model supplies an established foundation for one of those representations ([60](#ref-60))." nil)
